article.common-document
  header.header
    h2.title BBJ2K dataset
  .contents
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Summary
      p.body
        | BBJ2K is the name used in TogoVar for the dataset-specific allele frequencies and genotype counts for
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000868') JGAD000868
        |  in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-internal(href='/doc/datasets/jga_wgs') JGA-WGS
        | . These aggregate data for the Japanese population were obtained by reanalyzing individual-level
        | WGS data registered in the
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/') NBDC Human Database
        | /
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://www.ddbj.nig.ac.jp/jga/index-e.html') Japanese Genotype-phenotype Archive (JGA)
        |  for 1,964 participants in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://biobankjp.org/english/index.html') BioBank Japan
        | . TogoVar provides these data on GRCh38.
      ul.unordered-list
        li Sample size: 1,964
        li Reference genome: GRCh38
        li Number of alternate alleles searchable in TogoVar: 55,344,184
        li
          | Individual-level WGS data before processing:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000495') JGAD000495

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Data processing method
      ul.unordered-list
        li
          | Explanation:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/whole-genome-sequencing') Whole genome sequencing analysis data (germline)
        li
          | Workflow Source Code (jga-analysis):
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://github.com/ddbj/jga-analysis') https://github.com/ddbj/jga-analysis

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Relationship between dataset IDs
      p.body
        | The WGS data from the same 1,964 participants have separate dataset IDs for different processing stages:
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000495') JGAD000495
        |  for the individual-level WGS data before processing and
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000868') JGAD000868
        |  for the GRCh38 imputation reference panel.
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Terms of use
      p.body
        | Aggregated frequencies in TogoVar are publicly viewable. To use the individual-level WGS data before processing
        | or controlled-access processed data, specify JGAD000495 and JGAD000868 when applying through
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/data-use') Data Use
        | .
